// Boundary rules mirror smAgent.stubAnchorMatches: a trailing key char
// (digit/'-') rejects ('pr-1591' never matches 'pr-15910'), and a
// letter/'-' prefix rejects ('pr-1591' never matches 'gh-pr-1591-x').
